        </div>


        <div class="time-box">

            <strong id="minutes">
                00
            </strong>

            <span>
                MINUTES
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="time-box">

            <strong id="seconds">
                00
            </strong>

            <span>
                SECONDS
            </span>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div
        class="countdown-note"
        id="countdownNote">

        Counting every second until
        8 September 2026 ❤️

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =======================================================
     MESSAGE
======================================================= -->

<section class="message-section">

    <div class="message-card">

        <h2>
            Dear Diya...
        </h2>


        <p>

            I don't know if words can ever completely
            explain what your presence means to me.

            <br><br>

            But today I wanted to try.

            <br><br>

            Because sometimes a person becomes special
            without even trying.

            Through random conversations,
            stupid jokes,
            little arguments,
            unforgettable moments
            and countless memories...

            <br><br>

            somehow you became someone
            I genuinely don't want to lose.

        </p>


        <div class="typing">

            <span id="typingText"></span>

            <span class="cursor"></span>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =======================================================
     REASONS
======================================================= -->

<section class="reasons">

    <h2 class="section-title">
        Why You Are Special ❤️
    </h2>


    <div class="reason-grid">


        <div class="reason">

            <div class="reason-icon">
                😂
            </div>

            <h3>
                THE RANDOM MOMENTS
            </h3>

            <p>
                The conversations that make absolutely
                no sense but somehow become the memories
                we remember the most.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="reason">

            <div class="reason-icon">
                🤍
            </div>

            <h3>
                THE COMFORT
            </h3>

            <p>
                Being able to talk without pretending
                to be someone else is something
                genuinely rare.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="reason">

            <div class="reason-icon">
                🌸
            </div>

            <h3>
                YOUR PRESENCE
            </h3>

            <p>
                Sometimes you don't even have to say
                anything. Just being around makes
                things feel better.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="reason">

            <div class="reason-icon">
                🥹
            </div>

            <h3>
                THE MEMORIES
            </h3>

            <p>
                Ordinary moments somehow become
                extraordinary when they become
                memories.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="reason">

            <div class="reason-icon">
                ✨
            </div>

            <h3>
