            </h3>

            <p>
                Some smiles disappear from your sight
                but somehow stay inside your memory.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="reason">

            <div class="reason-icon">
                🫶
            </div>

            <h3>
                JUST YOU
            </h3>

            <p>
                No complicated explanation.

                You're simply someone
                I care about deeply.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =======================================================
     GALLERY
======================================================= -->

<section class="gallery">

    <h2 class="section-title">
        A Few Beautiful Moments 📸
    </h2>

    <div class="gallery-subtitle">
        TWO PHOTOGRAPHS • COUNTLESS FEELINGS
    </div>


    <div class="gallery-grid">


        <div class="photo-card">

            <img
                src="IMG_0833.jpeg"
                alt="Beautiful memory of Diya">

            <div class="photo-overlay"></div>

            <div class="photo-caption">

                <h3>
                    That Smile ❤️
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Some moments deserve
                    to be remembered forever.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="photo-card">

            <img
                src="IMG_0832.jpeg"
                alt="Beautiful memory of Diya">

            <div class="photo-overlay"></div>

            <div class="photo-caption">

                <h3>
                    A Beautiful Moment ✨
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Another little memory
                    that makes me smile.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


    </div>

</section>


<!-- =======================================================
     CINEMATIC QUOTE
======================================================= -->

<section class="quote-section">

    <div class="quote">

        "Maybe the most beautiful part
        of some people entering our life

        <br>

        is not knowing
        <span>how much they will eventually mean.</span>"

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =======================================================
     MEMORY TIMELINE
======================================================= -->

<section class="memory">

    <h2 class="section-title">
        Our Little Story 🌙
    </h2>


    <div class="timeline">


        <div class="memory-item">

            <h3>
