                What started as something simple
                slowly became something I genuinely
                started caring about.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="memory-item">

            <h3>
                Then Came The Conversations
            </h3>

            <p>
                The silly conversations,
                teasing, jokes,
                serious talks
                and everything in between.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="memory-item">

            <h3>
                Then Came The Memories
